---
// Contact. The verified professional email is the primary action; GitHub and
// LinkedIn remain as the two supporting links.
---

<section class="contact page-gutter" id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
  <div class="contact__inner">
    <h2 class="contact__title" id="contact-title">Get in touch</h2>
    <p class="contact__text">
      The clearest way to start a conversation is to write. The code and the
      research are open to read as well.
    </p>

    <a class="contact__email" href="mailto:miraabhakta@gmail.com">
      <span class="contact__email-label">Email</span>
      <span class="contact__email-address">miraabhakta@gmail.com</span>
    </a>

    <ul class="contact__links">
      <li class="contact__link-item">
        <a
          class="contact__link"
          href="https://github.com/mirabhakta"
          rel="me noopener"
          target="_blank"
        >
          <span class="contact__link-label">GitHub</span>
          <span class="contact__link-detail">github.com/mirabhakta</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li class="contact__link-item">
        <a
          class="contact__link"
          href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/mirabbhakta"
          rel="me noopener"
          target="_blank"
        >
          <span class="contact__link-label">LinkedIn</span>
          <span class="contact__link-detail">linkedin.com/in/mirabbhakta</span>
        </a>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <p class="contact__note">
      Open to research collaboration, engineering conversations, and internships
      in AI, data, or product work.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
